        <obo:IAO_0000115>A phenotypic abnormality.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C4021819</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Organ abnormality</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>human_phenotype</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000118</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Collapsed from hp.owl (HP_0000118 subClassOf UPHENO_0001003) and upheno.owl (UPHENO_0001003 subClassOf UPHENO_0001001); the local hp.obo omits both. Stated by the owners, not by this build.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>This is the root of the phenotypic abnormality subontology of the HPO.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Phenotypic abnormality</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
